WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 15 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.140
You want to separate from me?

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.140
If you're no longer attracted to me,

3
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.140
then what is left for us?

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.140
What remains is me.

5
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.140
I do everything.

6
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.140
I built my skating career from scratch.

7
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.140
Is that really what you think?

8
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.140
Yes! You don't skate.

9
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.140
I made custom boards for you,

10
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.140
which you rode out of love.

11
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.140
Even though they probably held me back.

12
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.140
At every photoshoot,

13
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.140
and every skating session early in the morning,

14
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.140
I was there.

15
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.140
Cheering you on and supporting you,

16
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.140
and standing by you.

17
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.140
So how was I holding you back, Fares?

18
00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.140
I dragged my heavy worries along with me.

19
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.140
In reality, I'm the one who should get a divorce.

20
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.140
Fine.

21
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.140
Is that all you have to say?

22
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.140
We should get divorced.

23
00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.140
If you want to believe it's a good idea, fine.

24
00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.140
I'm used to that.

25
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.140
What does that mean?

26
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.140
I don't think I was being vague.

27
00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.140
You like being associated with skating.

28
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:50.140
I take the credit for myself.

29
00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.140
Do you think polishing the boards

30
00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.140
and running the house supports me?

31
00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.140
I can't believe you left me

32
00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:58.140
the day before the exhibition, the most important day of my career.

33
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.140
It's also our wedding anniversary.

34
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:03.140
Which means you never appreciated me at all.

35
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.140
I'll be at the trade show.

36
00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.140
If you need anything.

37
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.140
And after that, we'll get divorced.
